    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86">

                <pb facs="0353" n="67" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg67"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-22T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 22, 1916, 8 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3606. Your 4626, November 20, 7 p. m. Make every endeavor to secure and telegraph
                    Chancellor’s statement to Hale. German Embassy endeavoring
                    to prevent publication here, and Hale cablegram may now be
                    held up by German censor.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
